<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - National Steel, Weirton Steel, Unifi and Aydin Corp.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - National Steel, Weirton Steel, Unifi and Aydin Corp.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday National Steel Corp, Weirton Steel Corp, Unifi Inc, and Aydin Corp were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA is also unavailable for after-hours trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
